README.INVERSION

DISCLAIMER:

Data submitted by source providers may vary from version to version, 
including changes in file names and file formats.  The source inversion 
spec is also subject to change.  It is the responsibility of the inverter 
to evaluate source data and determine how/whether to accomodate 
changes/additions and deletions, and to update the source inversion 
accordingly.

RSAB: MDR 

Last update of this file:  09/24/2026
Last VSAB inverted using this README: MDR_29_1 

Overview:  

This is a local source insertion using Meddra source files. 

A.  Files from source provider

1)  Required files
	hlt.asc
	hlgt.asc
	intl_ord.asc
	llt.asc
	mdhier.asc
	pt.asc
	soc.asc
	smq_list.asc
	smq_content.asc

2)  Other files provided by source provider
	hlgt_hlt.asc
	hlt_pt.asc
	meddra_history.asc
	meddra_release.asc
	soc_hlgt.asc

	hlgt.seq
	hlgt_hlt.seq
	hlt.seq
	hlt_pt.seq
	intl_ord.seq
	llt.seq
	mdhier.seq
	pt.seq
	soc.seq
	soc_hlgt.seq

	ICD-10 to MedDRA Map - June 2023.xlsx

	intguide_<ver>_English.pdf
	detail_report_<ver>_English.pdf
	dist_file_format_<ver>English.pdf
	readme_<ver>_English.txt
	SMQ_intguide_<ver>_English.pdf
	SMQ_spreadsheet_<ver>_English.xlsx
	version_report_<ver>_English.xlsx
	whatsnew_<ver>_English.pdf

B.  Scripts and other files required for source inversion 
1) scripts
	setup.csh 
	get.versions4mdr.s (see note below on running this file)
	invert_mdr.s  - wrapper script
		invert_mdr.pl
		append_atn.pl
		$INV_HOME/bin/makeDoc.pl
		$INV_HOME/bin/srcQa.pl
		$INV_HOME/bin/findQaStats.pl

2) other useful scripts and files:
	a. #OBSOLETE - etc/COSTART_classes_atoms.src (copy from prev. inversion, verify version through NCI MRSAB.RRF)

	b. #OBSOLETE - etc/ICD9CM_classes_atoms.src (copy from UMLS inversion, verify version through NCI MRSAB.RRF )

	c. #OBSOLETE - bin/occs_default_stys (output file after creating default 		STYs using "invert_mdr.pl -s"; default STYs automatically appended to 
	attributes.src)

	d. etc/MG_Abbreviations (copy from prev. inversion)

	e. orig/mdr_by_version.txt (see note below)
		

C.  Process
(step-by-step instructions on how to run the inversion)

1. $INV_HOME/bin/create_vsab_dirs.pl <VSAB>
