4. Unzip file into orig/fromprovider directory. 

5.  Update etc/MDR configuration file

6.  Update sources.src by using dump_src_info.pl and make.sources.src.pl.
        a) $INV_HOME_OLD/bin/dump_src_info.pl [-d <db>] [-r <RSAB> | <SAB> | -f <SF>] > template
        b) edit template
        c) $INV_HOME_OLD/bin/make.sources.src.pl template > sources.src

7.  Update termgroups.src 

8.  Before running 'invert_mdr.s' script, need to run a file called
'get.versions4mdr.s'.  This script creates a file called
'mdr_by_version.txt' which provides the values for the ATN =
PT_IN_VERSION.  In order to get previous versions starting from MDR
8.0 to the current released version, the script is kept and run on 
NLM's devmlbapp01 server in /umls_s/src_root/MDR<ver>/bin. (The script will need to be updated with the current SAB as future versions are processed).  
The output file (mdr_by_version.txt) should then be moved to ncias-q3793-v.nci.nih.gov and placed in the orig directory.

***Note: if unable to run in the dvlbmlapp01 /umls_s/src_root/MDR<ver>/bin directory due to permission restrictions, there is another copy on /umls_s/home/quans/MDR_version_script which can be run there.  A copy of the script is on (NCI) meme_work/inv/sources/MDR*/bin but this is just a copy.  It doesn't run on NCI machines.


9. Ftp data file from (UMLS) /umls_s/home/quans/MDR_version_script/mdr_by_version.txt to your GFE using SecureFX. 

