#12.  OBSOLETE STEP 3/2012 -- Mappings/XM atoms are not created for the NCI inversion of MDR. Copy etc/COSTART_classes_atoms.src from the prev. inversion. Verify version is still current through NCI MRSAB.RRF.

#13. OBSOLETE STEP 3/2012-- Mappings/XM atoms are not created for the NCI inversion of MDR. Copy etc/ICD9CM_classes_atoms.src from the UMLS inversion. Verify version through NCI MRSAB.RRF.

14.  Run bin/invert_mdr.s

15.  Perform conservation of mass/QA

16.  Finalize the source inversion proposal

17.  Create a README.INVERSION file.

18.  Create a SIMS record.

19.  Announce that the source is ready for test insertion.

#20.  OBSOLETE as of 9/9/2024. Default STYs now created as part of the insertion process.
	Create default STYs using 'invert_mdr.pl -s' after the test 
	insertion is complete.
	a) move test/sty_term_ids to src 
	b) run invert_mdr.pl -s

D.  Considerations for next inversion:
	1. Update the etc/MG_Abbreviations file using the list of 
abbreviations and expansions found on the MDR website 
(http://www.meddramsso.com/subscriber_acronyms_abbreviations.asp).

	For 2015, NLM decided not to update the list.  To remain
	consistant, NCI will not update the list either. 

	2. Can the 'get.versions4mdr.s' script be altered to use the
MR* files on nciws-p385-v rather than NLM's files?

E.  Inversion changes
	1. The whoart, icd*, harts, and costart fields were blank for this version.  ATN = CROSS_REFERENCE and RELA = mapped_from deprecated.
